-- ============================================================================
-- Mooney library pictures — load the Drive mockups straight into product_images.
--
-- The drive-sync function is deployed but its Google key secret
-- (GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON) was never set, so it has never pulled a
-- picture. This file adds the same rows the sync would have written
-- (189 mockups across the 33 library products, FRONT + BACK per color, Black
-- first). Rows are tagged exactly like the sync's (metadata.source = 'drive',
-- drive_file_id), so once the key is added the sync takes them over cleanly.
--
-- Additive, safe to run twice (skips files a product already has).
-- Paste into Supabase > SQL Editor and Run.
-- UNDO: delete from product_images where metadata->>'seeded_by' = 'library-pictures-2026-10-17';
-- ============================================================================
